 id=3D"TrainAgentsToControlQuanserQUBEPendulumExample-4">Create TD3 Agent</=
h3><p>The agent used in this example is a twin-delayed deep deterministic p=
olicy gradient (TD3) agent. TD3 agents use two parameterized Q-value functi=
on approximators to estimate the value (that is, the expected cumulative lo=
ng-term reward) of the policy.</p><p>To model the parameterized Q-value fun=
ction within both critics, use a neural network with two inputs (the observ=
ation and action) and one output (the value of the policy when taking a giv=
